#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:5
msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"These pages are the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-using-sensors-"
"actuators`` agent skill (`skills/user/use-sensors-actuators/ "
"<../../../../skills/user/use-sensors-actuators/SKILL.md>`__). When sensor "
"behavior changes, keep the API documentation, maintained demos, these "
"concept pages, and the skill synchronized."
msgstr ""
"这些页面是 ``isaaclab-using-sensors-actuators`` 智能体技能的权威参考（ `skills/user/use-"
"sensors-actuators/ <../../../../skills/user/use-sensors-"
"actuators/SKILL.md>`__ ）。传感器行为发生变化时，请同步更新 API 文档、维护中的演示程序、这些概念页面和该技能。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"Sensors turn simulation state or rendered scene data into batched "
"measurements. Every Isaac Lab sensor derives from "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase` and follows the same lifecycle:"
msgstr ""
"传感器将仿真状态或渲染场景数据转换为批量测量值。Isaac Lab 的所有传感器都继承自 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase` ，并遵循相同的生命周期："

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"``prim_path`` selects the prim or prims measured in every cloned "
"environment."
msgstr "``prim_path`` 选择每个克隆环境中要测量的一个或多个 prim。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"``update_period`` sets the sampling period in simulated seconds. A value of "
"``0.0`` samples every simulation step."
msgstr "``update_period`` 设置采样周期，以仿真秒计。 ``0.0`` 表示每个仿真步都采样。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:20
msgid ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase.update` advances the sensor clock. "
"Sensor data is evaluated lazily when the "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase.data` property is read, unless "
"recomputation or debug visualization is requested."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase.update` "
"推进传感器时钟。除非请求重新计算或调试可视化，否则传感器数据会在读取 :attr:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase.data`"
" 属性时才进行惰性计算。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:23
msgid ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase.reset` clears per-environment timestamps"
" and internal state."
msgstr ":meth:`~isaaclab.sensors.SensorBase.reset` 清除各环境的时间戳和内部状态。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"With eager sensor updates (``scene.cfg.lazy_sensor_update=False``), "
"``scene.update(dt)`` refreshes sensor data before returning. It advances "
"sensor clocks in scene order, updating ordinary sensors individually and "
"collecting sensors that support batch updates. After the loop, it refreshes "
"the collected sensors' pending buffers together. Each sensor retains its own"
" update period and reset state. Camera sensors use this mechanism to "
":ref:`batch captures by renderer <renderer-camera-batching>`."
msgstr ""
"采用即时传感器更新（ ``scene.cfg.lazy_sensor_update=False`` ）时， ``scene.update(dt)`` "
"会在返回前刷新传感器数据。它按场景顺序推进传感器时钟，逐个更新普通传感器，并收集支持批量更新的传感器。循环结束后，它统一刷新所收集传感器中待更新的缓冲区。各传感器保留自己的更新周期和重置状态。相机传感器使用该机制"
" :ref:`按渲染器批量采集 <renderer-camera-batching>` 。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"Sensor data is exposed through :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` "
"buffers, including camera outputs. Use the ``torch`` property for a cached "
"zero-copy Torch view or ``warp`` for the underlying Warp array."
msgstr ""
"传感器数据（包括相机输出）通过 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` 缓冲区提供。使用 ``torch`` "
"属性获取缓存的零拷贝 Torch 视图，或使用 ``warp`` 获取底层 Warp 数组。"

